{
  "uid": "wcl-team-improvement",
  "title": "Agent Team: Improvement",
  "description": "Sprint-over-sprint facts of the agent team: cost, flow, collaboration and per-agent context. Pushed at each wrap-up by .claude/team/teamstats.py.",
  "tags": [
    "wcl-agent",
    "build"
  ],
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "sprint",
        "label": "Sprint",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "mimir"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(team_sprint_points, sprint)",
          "refId": "v"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(team_sprint_points, sprint)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 2,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Sprint ends",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(255, 152, 48, 0.9)",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "mimir"
        },
        "expr": "max by (sprint) (team_sprint_points)",
        "step": "60s",
        "titleFormat": "Sprint {{sprint}} ends",
        "textFormat": "{{sprint}}: see Agent Team: Improvement",
        "tagKeys": "sprint",
        "useValueForTime": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**How to read this.** Each sprint's wrap-up pushes its facts here (`.claude/team/teamstats.py`): cost and shares from the baseline in `meta/team-optimisation.md`, per-agent tokens from `usage.txt`, collaboration from the team board. Read cost **next to** quality and flow: a cheaper sprint that skipped QA (10-31) is not an improvement. Why a number moved lives in the change log of `meta/team-optimisation.md`; the orange markers on the time axis of the other build dashboards are sprint ends."
      }
    },
    {
